From 6fad8cde0c83df7c3af866768868ca761a6b5160 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:43:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] Agenda of the appointments with the professionals

Tapping the next appointment on the follow-up card opens the upcoming
appointments as a patient, earliest first: date, kind, professional, area,
duration, place and the professional's notes. An appointment can be
cancelled after confirming; the server tells the professional. The card
reloads afterwards. The labels shared by the card and the agenda move to
features/care/care.dart.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
